   "rule": "kept: every interface (no de-duplication) whose catalog Bases include OutSystems.Model.IObject (object) or IObjectSignature only (signature); excluded: *Descriptor and interfaces without those roots; names are qualified in the catalog (bases, creatables, property types), so no resolution ambiguity arises except for property types written as short names; the catalog has no method list (Delete/Duplicate assumed from IObject). Identity = platform:metadataVersion:namespace.name (assembly not recorded by the catalog)",
   "kindClassRule": "referenced-signature = role signature (base closure reaches IObjectSignature but not IObject); concrete-authorable = role object with a factory that returns exactly this type (ODC: Create* method resolved without ambiguity; O11: catalog Creatables) or, when no other inventoried interface has it as a base, a widget/flow-node interface created through the generic CreateWidget<T>/CreateNode<T>; base-interface = role object without such a factory that appears in the resolved base closure of another inventoried interface (its properties and operations are kept; it is not counted as an extra concrete element); undetermined = role object with neither a factory nor an implementer (possibly created by the platform, not verified). A concrete type that is also a base of others keeps alsoBaseOf",
   "appFamilyRule": "tag from namespace/name: web = OutSystems.Model.UI.Web or Web*/IWeb* names; reactive = OutSystems.Model.UI.Mobile, NRWidgets plugin or Mobile*/IMobile* names; shared = the rest. A tag, not an exclusion: types tagged web stay in the inventory and in the per-kind denominators; the reader census tells whether ODC objects implement them",
   "attributionRule": "evidence keyed by a short name (jobs, ledger, descriptor, reader census) is attributed to a qualified type only when: exact = the short name has one qualified type in the platform inventory; kernel-rank (create only) = the kernel ranking of Verbs.cs FindCreateCore leaves one top candidate (NRWidgets > OutSystems.Model.* > Extensions/ExternalLibraries/Processes/BusinessProcesses); module-context = after removing the OutSystems.Model.Extensions and OutSystems.Model.ExternalLibraries candidates (extension-module types, \"never what an eSpace creates\", Verbs.cs:904-905) one candidate remains; otherwise ambiguous = recorded under the short name, attributed to no qualified type and not counted as proof"
